; shr_amount_at_or_above_word_size: the SHR mirror of
; shl_amount_at_or_above_word_size.
;
; This is the starker half. Python's `8 >> 64` is 0, well inside the i64
; range, so it never reached any check: the program completed with 0 on the
; stack while Rust raised InvalidShift. No overflow was involved, so nothing
; in the arithmetic sweep could have found it.

PUSH 8
PUSH 64
SHR
HALT
